                "message": "🐛 Fix the citar preload failing on every file and not writing its cache\n\nSet the slots of citar's cache objects by offset instead of with setf on\naccessors that were unknown when the module loaded, check that the\ninstalled citar has the cache the preload uses, and write the disk cache\nat the end of a pass, after an error and at exit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiCyfpEM7dFcJmFXN4v",
                "tree": {
